Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:55:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Speed up material lookups during openEMS operator setup

FindPropertyByCoordPriority takes the primitive list by const& (the
by-value GetPropertyByCoordPriority forwards to it, ABI kept), and
CSPropMaterial::GetWeight returns the plain value without building the
atan2/asin parameter set when no weighting function is set.

Generated-by: Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic)
Signed-off-by: Angel Martinez <110217098+anmartinez1256@users.noreply.github.com>
